"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Free mode by default, no tone restrictions. The AI can complain, gloat, feel anxious, smirk, free-as"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"sociate — or say nothing at all. You can also switch to preset personas (tsundere, cold, philosopher"},{"id":"p11s3","text":", etc.) to give the monologue a specific style. Whether to produce monologue is entirely up to the A"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"etc.) to give the monologue a specific style. Whether to produce monologue is entirely up to the AI."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> **Detailed installation docs:** Full installation guides (with troubleshooting) for each platform "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"at docs/installation.md."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### For AI Agents"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Paste the following prompt to let your AI agent install AI Inner OS automatically:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Verify Installation"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"After installation, run `/ai-inner-os:inner-os`. If you see the following output, the installation i"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ation, run `/ai-inner-os:inner-os`. If you see the following output, the installation is successful:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Claude Code (Recommended)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Run `/reload-plugins` after installation to activate in the current session — no restart needed. Det"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ailed installation guide."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> **Enable auto-update:** Third-party marketplaces don't auto-update by default. After installation,"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" enable auto-update for `SummerSec/AI-Inner-Os` in `/plugin` → Marketplaces tab, or manually run:\n>\n"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"-update for `SummerSec/AI-Inner-Os` in `/plugin` → Marketplaces tab, or manually run:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Codex CLI"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"See codex/README.md | Detailed installation guide."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Cursor"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The repository also includes `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json`, which packages `cursor/` as a Cursor plug"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"in component directory."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"See cursor/README.md | Detailed installation guide."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### OpenCode CLI"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"See opencode/README.md | Detailed installation guide."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Hermes Agent"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"See hermes/README.md | Detailed installation guide."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### OpenClaw"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"See openclaw/README.md | Detailed installation guide."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Optional User Profile Skill"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"AI Inner OS includes an opt-in `user-profile-distillation` skill. It can analyze prompts the user pa"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"stes, or local prompt history after explicit approval, to summarize work style, communication prefer"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"ences, and collaboration suggestions."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"This skill is disabled by default. It does not proactively read history, does not output long sensit"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"ive prompt excerpts, and does not save a profile unless the user explicitly asks. If the user opts i"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"nto continuous evolution, it keeps a visible versioned profile in the current conversation with a ch"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"ange log, but still does not create persistent memory by default."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Persona Switching"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Inner OS supports setting character personalities and tones for inner monologue. Personas only affec"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"t the `▎InnerOS：` prefixed monologue content — they don't affect main task responses."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"### Preset Personas"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"| Name | Display Name | Style |"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"| default | Free Mode | No fixed persona, free expression |\n| tsundere | Tsundere | Tough on the out"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"side, soft inside; snarky; \"it's not like I did it for you\" |\n| cold | Cold | Minimalist, to the poi"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"nt, no wasted words |\n| cheerful | Cheerful | Positive, encouraging, occasionally over-enthusiastic "},{"id":"p47s4","text":"|\n| philosopher | Philosopher | Deep, metaphorical, everything becomes philosophy |\n| sarcastic | Sa"},{"id":"p47s5","text":"rcastic | Sharp-tongued, hits the nail on the head, no mercy |"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"### Switching Commands (Claude Code)"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"### Custom Personas"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Create `.md` files in the `personas/custom/` directory to add custom personas. See personas/custom/R"},{"id":"p51s2","text":"md` files in the `personas/custom/` directory to add custom personas. See personas/custom/README.md."},{"id":"p52s1","text":"### Other Platforms"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"- **Codex CLI:** Manually edit `personas/_active.json`, set `persona` to the target persona name\n- *"},{"id":"p53s2","text":"*Cursor:** Manually append the body content of `personas/<name>.md` to the `.mdc` rule file\n- **Open"},{"id":"p53s3","text":"Code:** Manually append the body content of `personas/<name>.md` to `inner-os-rules.md`"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"## Protocol Design"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"The Inner OS behavior protocol is defined in `protocol/SKILL.md`, serving as the single source of tr"},{"id":"p55s2","text":"uth. All platform adapters derive from this protocol."},{"id":"p56s1","text":"Core principles:"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"- **Main task first** — Monologue cannot replace actual deliverables\n- **Monologue is optional** — W"},{"id":"p57s2","text":"hether to output is decided by the AI\n- **Unified format** — Uses the `▎InnerOS：` prefix\n- **Switcha"},{"id":"p57s3","text":"ble persona** — Define monologue style through persona files"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
